# layout package

Standalone module at `layout/go.mod`. Zero third-party deps.

## Entry points

```go
func Layout(params Params) (Result, error)
func Validate(params Params) error
```

## Source map

| File | Responsibility |
|------|----------------|
| `types.go` | `Shape`, `Item`, `Params`, `Bounds` |
| `validate.go` | Structural validation + wall validation |
| `wall.go` | `WallBounds()`, `footprintFitsWall`, centerpiece-in-wall check |
| `geometry.go` | `Footprint`, shape-aware bbox/collision geometry |
| `collision.go` | `Collides` with gap |
| `adjacency.go` | `Adjacent` — connectivity within gap |
| `placed.go` | `PlacedItem`, `Cluster`, `Bounds()` |
| `order.go` | Centerpiece find, sort (area ↓, max side ↓, id ↑), anchor at origin |
| `candidates.go` | Perimeter + corner attachment, 1-unit slide, dedupe, wall filter |
| `score.go` | w1–w5 weighted score, `BestCandidate` |
| `layout.go` | Orchestrator: validate → anchor → place loop → `buildResult` |
| `result.go` | `Result`, `PlacedResult`, `Anchor` JSON types |
| `output.go` | Top-left coords, direction, `adjacentIDsFor` |
| `errors.go` | `ValidationError`, `PlacementError`, `IsValidationCode`, `IsPlacementCode` |
| `quality.go` | Regression helpers: aspect ratio, hull fill, neighbor checks |
| `doc.go` | Package godoc |

## Params & wall

- `Gap` (required): minimum separation between frames.
- `WallWidth` / `WallHeight` (optional): both must be > 0 or both omitted/zero. Wall is centered on anchor; candidates and placements must fit inside.
- Validation codes include `invalid_wall`, `centerpiece_exceeds_wall`.

## Placement loop

1. `Validate(params)`
2. Anchor centerpiece at `(0, 0)`
3. Sort remaining items
4. For each item: `GenerateCandidates` → filter collisions/floaters/wall → `BestCandidate` → append to cluster
5. `buildResult` with bounds and hanging helpers

## Testing

```bash
go test .                              # from layout/
go test ./layout/...                   # from repo root (needs go.work)
go test -run Golden -v                 # golden JSON in testdata/
go test -run Example -v                # godoc examples
```

Golden fixtures: `testdata/centerpiece_*`, `twentyfive_*`. Regenerate carefully — positions are deterministic but scoring tweaks change output.

